  "proof": "For each listed cut, every state row of its H-only coefficient matrix is exactly constant across token z. Hence for every row-stochastic Q, sum_tz A[t,z]Q[t,z]=sum_t A[t,0]. If this constant is below rho-delta, that single cut proves the registered bank infeasible independent of task cost or solver.",
